  "notes_for_editor": "Forest disputed: Boise National Forest (Forest Lookouts) against Challis National Forest (firelookout.com, Idaho Fire Lookouts); the record uses Boise and the story says so. The 1939 and 1950 dates trace to Kresek (surname only) as the Boise page credits, and the other pages repeat them, so they are one lineage, not independent confirmation. Elevation 9263 ft (about 2,824 m) is on firelookout.com only; Idaho Fire Lookouts gives it as unknown and the Boise page gives none. Record elevation_m is null and could be filled. Record point (44.7586, -114.5562) is about 1.2 km from the point the firelookout.com map and FFLA list give (44.76163, -114.54126); no correction proposed. No photos found. Nothing confirms current condition or access.",
